<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with a NON-DEFAULT AVFT
table (county-inputs/washtenaw-county-avft/setup-avft.sql over
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql). MOVES 5 runs
AVFTControlStrategy because `avft` has rows, and AVFTMasterLoopable rewrites
sampleVehiclePopulation.stmyFraction before any generator runs: the passenger
car (21), light commercial truck (32) and combination long-haul truck (62)
gain and lose gasoline, diesel, E85, CNG and electric vehicles at model years
2010, 2015, 2018 and 2020, through both of applyNewFraction's branches, its
1e-6 threshold and a combination it ignores. Every fuel of 21 and 32
(gasoline, diesel, E85, electric) and 62's diesel and electric are selected,
so the moved fleet is in the output. No time aggregation
(<aggregateBy key="Hour"/>, <outputtimestep value="Hour"/>): July 2020,
weekdays, hour 8, road types 1 and 4. THC, CO, NOx and Total Energy at
running exhaust, start exhaust and extended idle; THC at fuel vapor venting
(MultidayTankVaporVentingCalculator weights by sampleVehiclePopulation
directly); PM2.5 brake and tire wear.]]></description>
